@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About Us";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>


<div id="carouselExampleSlidesOnly" class="carousel slide" data-bs-ride="carousel">
    <div class="carousel-inner">
        <div class="carousel-item active">
            <img src="~/images/mango.jpg" class="d-block w-100" alt="...">
        </div>
        <div class="carousel-item">
            <img src="~/images/rolls.png" class="d-block w-100" alt="...">
        </div>
        <div class="carousel-item">
            <img src="~/images/fram.jpg" class="d-block w-100" alt="...">
        </div>
    </div>
</div>


<div class="container mt-5"></div>


<div class="container">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12">
            <h1 style="text-align:left; font-size:22px;">
                🧁 About Us: The Alara Patisserie Story
            </h1>
            <p style="padding-left:35px;">
                Welcome! Alara Patisserie is more than just a dessert stop; it is a story of passion that merges a heritage of flavor with modern touches.
            </p>

            <h1 style="text-align:left; font-size:22px;">
                ✨ Our Vision and Origins
            </h1>
            <p style="padding-left:35px;">
                Alara Patisserie is founded upon flavor, freshness, and visual spectacle. In every one of our cakes, there lies a passion for bringing together the purple allure of blackberries, the natural richness of forest fruits, and the irresistible grandeur of chocolate.

                Edible Works of Art (Artisan Flavors): For us, making a cake is an art form. Just like our purple-creamed blackberry cake shimmering under the light filtering through the window, every product we make carries an elegance that appeals to both the eye and the palate.

                A Touch of Nature: We take care to use the freshest and highest-quality ingredients possible. Just as in our forest-themed cake, we want you to feel the peace and freshness of nature in our products.
            </p>
            <h1 style="text-align:left; font-size:22px;">
                💖 Quality and Detail
            </h1>
            <p style="padding-left:35px;">
                At Alara Patisserie, details are never overlooked. Every layer, every drop of sauce, and every fruit placement is carefully considered.

                "A cake is not just a dessert; it is a journey to happiness."

                For us, patisserie is the way to crown your most special moments and transform even a small occasion into a luxurious celebration. Whether you are looking for an elegant and dense chocolate layer or a refreshing fruity delight, at Alara Patisserie, there is definitely a feast prepared just for you, straight from the heart.

                We invite you to join us on this culinary journey for a slice of happiness.
            </p>
            
        </div>
    </div>
</div>


